---
// Nimbus architecture, from its AGENTS.md, RcloneClient.swift and MountManager.swift.
---

<figure class="stack">
  <div class="stack__grid">
    <div class="node node--surface" style="grid-area: app">
      <span class="node__label ui">You see</span>
      <span class="node__name">The Nimbus app</span>
    </div>
    <div class="node node--surface" style="grid-area: finder">
      <span class="node__label ui">You see</span>
      <span class="node__name">Your remotes in Finder</span>
      <span class="node__detail">File Provider extension</span>
    </div>
    <div class="node node--surface" style="grid-area: volume">
      <span class="node__label ui">You see</span>
      <span class="node__name">Mounted volumes</span>
      <span class="node__detail">A remote as a Finder volume</span>
    </div>

    <div class="node" style="grid-area: kit">
      <span class="node__name">RcloneKit</span>
      <span class="node__detail">A typed Swift client for rclone’s remote-control API, shared by the app and the extension</span>
    </div>
    <div class="node" style="grid-area: nfs">
      <span class="node__name">rclone serve nfs</span>
      <span class="node__detail">Mounted with the system’s own NFS client</span>
    </div>

    <div class="node node--engine" style="grid-area: engine">
      <span class="node__name">rclone, running locally</span>
      <span class="node__detail">One engine for every provider. Nimbus never reimplements one.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="node node--clouds" style="grid-area: clouds">
      <span class="node__name">S3, Google Drive, OneDrive, SFTP and more than fifty others</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="stack__caption">
    One engine, two clients. The app and its Finder extension talk to the same local rclone
    through RcloneKit; mounts go through rclone’s NFS server.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .stack { margin: 0; }

  .stack__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    grid-template-areas:
      'app    finder volume'
      'kit    kit    nfs'
      'engine engine engine'
      'clouds clouds clouds';
    gap: 1.6rem 1rem;
  }

  .node {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line-strong);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--color-ground);
  }
  /* A short connector down to the tier below. */
  .node:not(.node--clouds)::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: calc(-1.6rem - 1px);
    width: 1px;
    height: 1.6rem;
    background: var(--color-line-strong);
  }

  .node--surface { background: var(--color-surface); }
  .node--engine { border-color: var(--color-amber); }
  .node--clouds {
    border-style: dashed;
    background: transparent;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .node__label { color: var(--color-ink-3); font-size: 0.8125rem; }
  .node__name { font-size: 1.1875rem; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--color-ink); }
  .node__detail { font-size: 0.975rem; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--color-ink-2); }

  .stack__caption {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    max-width: 40em;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .stack__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-template-areas: 'app' 'finder' 'volume' 'kit' 'nfs' 'engine' 'clouds';
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
    .node::after { display: none; }
  }
</style>
